      }), " limit how much internal cost the system will incur before aborting an operation. If an operation has consumed $5 in LLM costs without producing a valid result, the system might terminate it rather than continuing to burn resources. This cap must be higher than typical operation costs but low enough to prevent runaway spending. ", _jsx(_components.strong, {
